{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55670","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 六十八 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 六十八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽栖带郭半山峰，密意虚怀莫可同。\n事到定中消息静，景於吟处炼磨空。\n玲珑色淡松根月，敲磕声清竹罅风。\n独坐独行谁会我，羣星朝北水朝东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55670.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55670","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}